              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of பராமரி (parāmari) is not settled. It looks like a Sanskrit loan made into a Tamil verb in -இ, perhaps from parāmarśa, \"seizing; consideration\" (Monier-Williams), but the link is uncertain."
